{"4013810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fantasy Kingdom Merchant Simulator", "steam_appid": 4013810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy Kingdom Merchant Simulator is a shop simulator where you sell potions, scrolls, swords, and armour to earn money, build your business, and become the greatest merchant of all time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/c318b97e9f39e506bb1eb116c7355fbe.avif?t=1770372427\" width=650 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the doors to your magical shop! Arrange shimmering potions, spellbound scrolls, and mythical weapons to catch the eye of every adventurer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/149debaf380e1d0deb7e9d65b0e2caf2.poster.avif?t=1770372427\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/149debaf380e1d0deb7e9d65b0e2caf2.webm?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/149debaf380e1d0deb7e9d65b0e2caf2.mp4?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/35f9095557e6a800c852554d7370b00f.avif?t=1770372427\" width=650 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use THE book to order stock. Unpack your goods, sort them in the storage room, and put them on shelves, weapon racks, or armour stands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/3623b44414d3886eb607d6e0c531e478.poster.avif?t=1770372427\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/3623b44414d3886eb607d6e0c531e478.webm?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/3623b44414d3886eb607d6e0c531e478.mp4?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/a6b281cbaae2279d9f164a612dbb0b2d.avif?t=1770372427\" width=650 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn profits, level up, and invest in artisans. Expand your store, enhance the interior, and stay current with your customers' needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/dc382e82ac7f25ef87d0b647473bd630.poster.avif?t=1770372427\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/dc382e82ac7f25ef87d0b647473bd630.webm?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/dc382e82ac7f25ef87d0b647473bd630.mp4?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/20fc1f74e467f0c0edb6a671f4671f59.avif?t=1770372427\" width=650 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your store looking great. Sweep the floor, take out the trash, and clean the pavement so everything stays neat. Make heroes feel like they are in a realm of wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/13112b2ef2804b63e45b3c4c780b3949.poster.avif?t=1770372427\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/13112b2ef2804b63e45b3c4c780b3949.webm?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/13112b2ef2804b63e45b3c4c780b3949.mp4?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy Kingdom Merchant Simulator is a shop simulator where you sell potions, scrolls, swords, and armour to earn money, build your business, and become the greatest merchant of all time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/c318b97e9f39e506bb1eb116c7355fbe.avif?t=1770372427\" width=650 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the doors to your magical shop! Arrange shimmering potions, spellbound scrolls, and mythical weapons to catch the eye of every adventurer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/149debaf380e1d0deb7e9d65b0e2caf2.poster.avif?t=1770372427\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/149debaf380e1d0deb7e9d65b0e2caf2.webm?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/149debaf380e1d0deb7e9d65b0e2caf2.mp4?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/35f9095557e6a800c852554d7370b00f.avif?t=1770372427\" width=650 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use THE book to order stock. Unpack your goods, sort them in the storage room, and put them on shelves, weapon racks, or armour stands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/3623b44414d3886eb607d6e0c531e478.poster.avif?t=1770372427\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/3623b44414d3886eb607d6e0c531e478.webm?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/3623b44414d3886eb607d6e0c531e478.mp4?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/a6b281cbaae2279d9f164a612dbb0b2d.avif?t=1770372427\" width=650 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn profits, level up, and invest in artisans. Expand your store, enhance the interior, and stay current with your customers' needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/dc382e82ac7f25ef87d0b647473bd630.poster.avif?t=1770372427\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/dc382e82ac7f25ef87d0b647473bd630.webm?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/dc382e82ac7f25ef87d0b647473bd630.mp4?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/20fc1f74e467f0c0edb6a671f4671f59.avif?t=1770372427\" width=650 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your store looking great. Sweep the floor, take out the trash, and clean the pavement so everything stays neat. Make heroes feel like they are in a realm of wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/13112b2ef2804b63e45b3c4c780b3949.poster.avif?t=1770372427\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/13112b2ef2804b63e45b3c4c780b3949.webm?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013810/extras/13112b2ef2804b63e45b3c4c780b3949.mp4?t=1770372427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are the merchant in a fantasy kingdom. Run the store, stock shelves with potions, magical weapons, and armour. Set prices, hire staff, and expand your business by collaborating with local artisans. Supply NPC heroes so they can keep battling the kingdom's enemies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https:/